Provider-Declaration-Fields: component_id,component_version,provider_api_id,provider_api_version,target_id,target_version,state_contract_id,state_contract_version,request_contract_id,request_contract_version,estimate_contract_id,estimate_contract_version,implementation_id,implementation_version,model_id,model_version,callable
Model-Identity-Rule: both_null_or_both_bounded
